SUMMARY:Orange Beach Freedom Fest 2026
DESCRIPTION:The city puts on two days of free festival at The Wharf\, and 
 the Bama Coast Cruisin' car show fills Main Street and Wharf Parkway insi
 de it. There are arts and crafts and food vendors\, a patriotic and milit
 ary booths section\, a kids zone\, live music both days\, and a Marshals 
 Mardi Gras motorcycle and Jeep rally. The car show has its own parade to 
 the beach at 3 PM on the Sunday. General admission to the festival and ca
 r show is free\, though the Gulf Coast Gun Collectors Association's firea
 rms show inside it charges its own separate ticket\, $10 cash or $11 by c
 redit\, with kids 10 and under free.\nPrice: Free\nArea: Orange Beach & G
 ulf Shores\nTimes: Sat 9/19 9 AM to 5 PM · Sun 9/20 10 AM to 3 PM\nCheck
 ed against the venue's own page on 2026-09-02\nhttps://coastaleventures.c
 om/events/ev-orange-beach-freedom-fest-2026-0919.html
